WEBVTT

00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:40.360
Yasaka Mahiro...
Do you take Yasaka Nyarlathotep to be your wife...

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:43.860
and promise to love her for the rest of your life?

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:46.780
I do.

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:49.910
Yasaka Nyarlathotep...

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:53.700
Do you take Yasaka Mahiro to be your husband...

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:57.460
and promise to love him for the rest of your life?

00:00:58.330 --> 00:00:59.460
I do.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.800
You may now kiss the bride.

00:01:41.050 --> 00:01:44.360
Haiyore!

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:41.770
Nyaruko-san

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:06.290
What was that dream about?

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:14.140
No, no, no! Nyaruko must've done something to me
with one of her crazy inventions, or something even worse.

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:17.350
Making me see a dream that she wanted me to...

00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:19.270
Of course, that must be it!

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:21.890
I'm gonna give her a piece of my mind.

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:24.480
Hey Nyaruko!

00:03:25.190 --> 00:03:29.320
Haiyore Nyaruko-san!
This makes it the third occurrence.

00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:33.280
#1: We had a showdown with a Cthulhuian. Done!

00:03:33.950 --> 00:03:36.450
Creatures like you...

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:39.040
will never be recognized by the Cthulhu.

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:48.380
#2: The race that was trying to take over the
Milky Way was defeated by their enemies!

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:51.130
I want to stop this war at once!

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:55.130
For that reason... we will sing!

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:56.890
With our voices,

00:03:56.890 --> 00:03:58.890
we will continue...

00:03:58.890 --> 00:04:02.480
Listen to our song!

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:08.110
#3: We have started our new School Haiyoru Project.

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:10.860
In order to protect our schools!

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:14.030
Our Lovecraft Live!

00:04:15.910 --> 00:04:17.120
Lovecraft
Live!

00:04:15.910 --> 00:04:17.120
School Haiyoru Project

00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:20.160
What is this?

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:22.370
Good morning, Mahiro-san!

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:25.420
I asked what is this?!

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:28.130
We made a fan movie.

00:04:28.670 --> 00:04:31.250
We're gonna upload it to Migo Migo Douga.

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:34.630
You should record with us some day Mahiro-kun!

00:04:34.630 --> 00:04:37.550
I will not! Plus, I wasn't talking about that.

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:39.050
Hey Nyaruko.

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:42.140
Yes, yes! Did you order a Nyaruko?

00:04:42.140 --> 00:04:44.850
If you want a morning kiss, I'll give
you one right here, right now.

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:49.110
Like I thought, what happened this morning
was your doing, wasn't it?

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:51.110
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:04:51.110 --> 00:04:54.690
You used some invention to make me see that dream.

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:55.780
Dream?

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:57.320
Which one?

00:04:58.070 --> 00:04:59.990
That me and Nyaruko were...

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:02.830
Yes? Me and Mahiro-san..?

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:05.040
That's why...

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:07.750
um...

00:05:13.090 --> 00:05:13.920
erm...

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:15.340
I see~

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:19.510
Mahiro-san is still in his high school years...

00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:22.180
and he is having these naughty dreams...

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:27.770
Mahiro grabbed me really hard and strong and made me his, right?

00:05:27.770 --> 00:05:29.190
I really want to see it.

00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:30.900
I never said that!

00:05:31.190 --> 00:05:34.110
If you say "I want you" with all the power in the universe...

00:05:34.110 --> 00:05:36.110
Nyaruko will be pregnant.

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:38.400
Certainly!

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:39.990
"Oo" will be "Nya!"

00:05:39.990 --> 00:05:41.410
"San" will be "Pinch!"

00:05:41.410 --> 00:05:43.370
I'm certain of it.

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:47.500
You've no choice but to take responsibility and marry me!

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:51.880
Therefore Mahiro-san, let's to what it
takes two people to do, immediately!

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:53.130
What?

00:05:51.920 --> 00:05:55.050
I will receive anything from you Mahiro-san.

00:05:53.210 --> 00:05:55.000
Quit fooling around!

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:58.050
Boy...

00:05:58.800 --> 00:06:03.470
For you to have a dream like that with
Nyaruko without my permission.

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:05.180
It's going to cost you.

00:06:05.430 --> 00:06:07.680
Why would we need <i>your</i> permission?!

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:09.270
Ah! That's enough!

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:11.150
Boy...

00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:14.270
Even though we're engaged...

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:18.530
That means it can be a three-way and
I can be married to Nyaruko too!

00:06:18.530 --> 00:06:19.650
Why did it come to that?!

00:06:20.570 --> 00:06:22.490
Ma-Mahiro-kun...

00:06:23.490 --> 00:06:24.370
Hasuta...

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:27.200
I trust you...

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:29.160
that in the end...

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:32.960
Mahiro-kun will come back to my side!

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:34.920
Nah, don't count on it.

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:37.090
In any case, Mahiro-san!

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:40.800
I said quit it-

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:43.970
Let's make the dream come true together.

00:06:44.720 --> 00:06:46.810
Me too, boy!

00:06:46.810 --> 00:06:48.560
Ma-Mahiro-kun!

00:06:48.770 --> 00:06:50.560
I love you! Mahiro-san!

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:51.440
Boy!

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:53.350
No fair, I do more!

00:06:53.730 --> 00:06:55.690
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

00:06:55.690 --> 00:06:56.400
Gyaos!

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:57.280
Migio!

00:06:57.280 --> 00:06:58.150
Giris!

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:02.360
Have you guys calmed down?

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:03.820
Yes.

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:07.330
Hey!

00:07:07.580 --> 00:07:09.330
Good morning, Yasaka-kun.

00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:12.750
What's up? Fancy seeing you two together on a day-off.

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:16.170
Come on, after all that work I did to prepare.

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:18.170
I'd like a bit more gratitude.

00:07:19.590 --> 00:07:23.300
It was really hard to get these tickets.

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:27.760
Right! The most popular amusement spot these days.

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:30.270
A realistic escape game.

00:07:32.440 --> 00:07:35.860
Haiyoru Switch-on,

00:07:34.270 --> 00:07:35.860
Chaos

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:35.860
incoming!

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:41.400
Is it really ok for me to come too?

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:47.030
Of course it is! Without you, it would be only half as fun.

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:48.450
Well, that makes me happy.

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:57.210
If I can keep this steady pace up,
I can become his girlfriend, for now.

00:07:57.210 --> 00:08:00.710
Just let it happen!

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:08.600
What's with that sigh?

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:11.350
Well, I always think about this but...

00:08:11.350 --> 00:08:14.270
Don't I have any say in this?

00:08:14.270 --> 00:08:15.520
Don't mind it.

00:08:16.020 --> 00:08:18.860
Cheer up, Mahiro-kun!

00:08:18.860 --> 00:08:23.150
That's right. Let's play a lot and have lots of fun!

00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:25.660
I see it.

00:08:26.410 --> 00:08:27.490
There.

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:31.160
Welcome.

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:34.750
I will be your attraction's tour guide.

00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:38.540
We are currently doing our required preparation.

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:40.630
Please wait a little bit.

00:08:41.550 --> 00:08:44.510
What a nice place, they even give you courtesy drinks.

00:08:44.510 --> 00:08:47.470
Maybe these are the secrets to its popularity.

00:08:48.390 --> 00:08:50.850
There is nobody here but us.

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:56.810
They say they don't allow many people at once,
so that the visitors can enjoy the attractions.

00:08:58.690 --> 00:09:00.650
Sorry for the wait!

00:09:00.650 --> 00:09:06.570
I will now need you to get into pairs,
clear the mission, and aim for the goal!

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:11.620
Once you've decided pairs,
you may proceed through a door of your choice.

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:14.330
Pair? Which means...

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:15.790
I'll be with Nyaruko!

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:17.580
I'll be with Mahiro-kun!

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:22.420
Alright! Rock, Paper, Scissors!

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:31.430
I won! The always smiling Mahiro is now next to...

00:09:31.430 --> 00:09:34.060
As I expected, it's me!

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:44.150
Wow, it's quite cozy.

00:09:44.360 --> 00:09:46.690
Let's do our best, Shantaa-kun!

00:09:50.030 --> 00:09:55.870
Everyone! Don't forget to stay with your partner!

00:09:51.370 --> 00:09:53.620
Nyaruko...

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:57.540
Understood!

00:09:57.830 --> 00:09:59.870
The Seven's escape from the curse!

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.130
Start!

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:44.920
Escape
Successful!

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:47.960
Hooray! We're first!

00:10:48.760 --> 00:10:54.850
I hope I get a chance to touch
Nyaruko while she's all wet n' slimy.

00:10:55.140 --> 00:10:57.600
Aw too bad. We lost.

00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:03.400
Who'd have thought there was an
attraction that required a bathing suit.

00:11:05.650 --> 00:11:10.070
I can no longer get married.

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:12.700
Is... that so...

00:11:15.530 --> 00:11:18.290
You two sure took your time!

00:11:18.290 --> 00:11:20.750
Oh? I guess we're last.

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:23.210
Well we did our best.

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:29.260
Here, here! As promised, let's go to the cake shop!

00:11:29.760 --> 00:11:31.130
Go easy on us, alright?

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:33.590
That was fun wasn't it Shantaa-kun?

00:11:35.550 --> 00:11:37.430
How was it for you two?

00:11:37.640 --> 00:11:40.180
We had a blast, of course.

00:11:40.180 --> 00:11:43.060
Yeah, we made nice memories.

00:11:43.810 --> 00:11:46.190
I see... That's great!

00:11:56.280 --> 00:11:58.030
What's going on here?!

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:02.660
The attraction's door is different! What's with these monsters?

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:06.080
I will destroy anyone who tries to harm Mahiro-san.

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:09.210
I will destroy everything, and terminate you all.

00:12:11.050 --> 00:12:15.260
With my Space CQC (close quarters combat) weapon.

00:12:16.140 --> 00:12:17.260
Huh?

00:12:18.100 --> 00:12:19.260
It vanished?

00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:22.020
Maybe it's another Space CQC jammer.

00:12:22.890 --> 00:12:27.650
Then how about, Space CQC Part 2!

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:31.900
Hey Nyaruko!

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:36.820
Not to fret. We still have nothing to worry about.

00:12:36.820 --> 00:12:43.620
Since it's come to this, I'll have to use
my sinister chaotic move. Lariat of Youth!

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:46.750
Why are you kicking if it's a lariat?!

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:51.630
No way...

00:12:54.590 --> 00:12:56.260
Yee-owwwwwch!

00:12:58.590 --> 00:13:01.310
Ow, ow, ouch!

00:13:04.230 --> 00:13:07.980
At last, the Space Nano-machines are starting to have effect.

00:13:08.270 --> 00:13:09.610
Who the hell are you?

00:13:09.610 --> 00:13:13.530
I'll beat your ass right here, show yourself!

00:13:13.530 --> 00:13:17.450
The Space Nano-machines I've dispersed through the air

00:13:17.450 --> 00:13:23.160
transmits through the nervous system,
and steals your memories and powers.

00:13:24.620 --> 00:13:27.410
When did you even do that?

00:13:33.090 --> 00:13:40.430
Very smart.  But now the Space Nano-machines are
transmitting through Nyarlathotep.

00:13:40.430 --> 00:13:49.770
In just one hour, all of Nyarlathotep's powers and memories will be wiped.

00:13:50.690 --> 00:13:57.490
Then all that will remain is a body with
with no heart or memories.

00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:01.070
The thing I want most is...

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:02.320
Haiyore! Nyaruko-san F

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:02.320
A secret.

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:09.000
My powers, and my memories..?

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:11.380
Nyaruko...

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:18.670
Mahiro-san! Let's make a lot of love before
my powers and memories go away.

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:20.090
You know what...!

00:14:22.930 --> 00:14:29.270
Besides, the Space Nano-machine thing he said, just because
it has the word Space doesn't mean it's from there.

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:31.980
The uu in Uchuu (space) will make you go uu!

00:14:31.980 --> 00:14:35.110
Space's technology is insane, like seriously.

00:14:35.570 --> 00:14:39.650
Nyarlathotep, you're being a hindrance to the plan.

00:14:39.950 --> 00:14:41.820
That's no good.

00:14:41.820 --> 00:14:44.030
Huh? What are you saying?

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:50.120
Oh, that's right! It's no use trying to contact anyone outside.

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:53.500
No Service.
Contact List
School

00:14:52.210 --> 00:14:56.300
Nyarlathotep will now turn into a normal human.

00:14:56.880 --> 00:15:01.590
You are not compatible with Space CQC.

00:15:02.260 --> 00:15:05.180
What is your objective?

00:15:07.850 --> 00:15:11.600
You Earthlings sure are very popular in entertainment.

00:15:12.350 --> 00:15:18.570
If you, the agent that works in these parts,
were to team up with me...

00:15:19.490 --> 00:15:20.990
Who the hell would agree to that?!

00:15:21.530 --> 00:15:27.830
Clear the mission. If you guys can make it
outside, you win. If you cannot, you lose.

00:15:29.870 --> 00:15:31.250
This is the game.

00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:33.250
Sounds fun, right?

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:36.380
This is not that type of game!

00:15:36.590 --> 00:15:38.880
If you change your mind, let me know.

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:40.300
Until then.

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:46.470
There's nothing to worry about.

00:15:47.510 --> 00:15:51.730
I will protect Mahiro-san for sure.

00:15:56.020 --> 00:15:57.860
Thanks for the food.

00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:03.110
It's delicious!

00:16:03.740 --> 00:16:07.070
It looks so good. What's that cake called?

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:12.660
"Flower Snow." In Japanese it'd be... Hana Yuki.

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:14.660
What about your cake, Kuuko-chan?

00:16:15.750 --> 00:16:20.590
White Sincerity. It's so tasty. This is the best.

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:23.510
How is it, Hiro-kun? Any good?

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:25.510
Yeah! It's delish~

00:16:25.510 --> 00:16:27.220
Yes, very!

00:16:28.850 --> 00:16:29.640
Great.

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:54.290
Crap. We just have to beat all these guys. But this is like level impossible!

00:16:56.170 --> 00:16:57.080
Nyaruko!

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:07.050
I didn't think it'd be this hard to control my own body.

00:17:07.680 --> 00:17:11.180
Nyaruko's strength just keeps diminishing.

00:17:13.140 --> 00:17:14.100
Dammit!

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:16.560
If only Kuuko and Hasuta were here...

00:17:17.850 --> 00:17:21.020
Who are Kuuko and Hasuta?

00:17:21.480 --> 00:17:24.070
Nyaruko... You...

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:25.650
Look out, Mahiro-san!

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:29.490
Nyaruko!

00:17:30.780 --> 00:17:34.750
Hey! Hang in there! Are you alright? Hey!

00:17:42.460 --> 00:17:46.340
Today was fun, Nyaruko-chan, Yasaka-kun.

00:17:46.720 --> 00:17:47.630
See you tomorrow!

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:49.050
Later!

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:53.850
Well then, we should get going too.

00:17:56.680 --> 00:18:00.190
Cut the crap and reveal yourself, impostors!

00:18:02.150 --> 00:18:06.610
We didn't want to involve Kurei-san and Yoichi-kun so we kept quiet...

00:18:07.110 --> 00:18:10.490
What have you done with the real Nyaruko and the Boy?

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:16.200
Looks like they don't want to answer.

00:18:19.370 --> 00:18:21.750
I'm sorry, Mahiro-san.

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:24.040
I'm not too heavy?

00:18:24.840 --> 00:18:26.630
You're fine, I can handle it.

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:31.760
Don't you remember when you got sick,
and I brought you to your bed like this?

00:18:32.550 --> 00:18:33.760
You did?

00:18:35.060 --> 00:18:36.770
For me?

00:18:38.430 --> 00:18:39.690
Mahiro-san...

00:18:41.310 --> 00:18:49.070
Can you tell me... how was our
relationship up until now?

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:51.070
How was it?

00:18:51.780 --> 00:18:53.370
Please.

00:18:54.870 --> 00:18:56.200
There was a lot of stuff.

00:18:56.950 --> 00:19:05.130
We went to R'lyeh Land, a Celaeno Library, and many others.
Which do you want to hear?

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:07.000
All of them.

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:09.800
Please tell me everything.

00:19:10.340 --> 00:19:16.850
Alright then. Let's see...
I'll start from when we went to R'lyeh Land.

00:19:20.270 --> 00:19:21.180
*whimper*

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:27.980
I wanted to craft a love doll with this Nyaruko body.

00:19:28.150 --> 00:19:30.690
This isn't the time for that crap.

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:34.910
Let's go back, we have to save them quickly!

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:42.460
I was really scared then.

00:19:42.460 --> 00:19:48.170
The Banshin that attacked me suddenly said, "I'm dying too!"

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:53.130
But, because you were there...
I somehow was feeling calm.

00:19:54.180 --> 00:19:57.470
Because I was there?

00:19:57.470 --> 00:20:02.810
Oh... yeah, that's right.  So then...

00:20:02.810 --> 00:20:04.810
Good to hear!

00:20:06.520 --> 00:20:11.860
It sounds like there aren't any bad memories with you.

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:17.950
To be honest, I thought you would hate me
for making you go through all of this.

00:20:18.990 --> 00:20:21.160
that's not it at all, idiot.

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:25.330
I could never... hate...

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:28.960
That's...

00:20:31.420 --> 00:20:32.840
The exit!

00:20:43.140 --> 00:20:46.020
We made it out! What do we do now?!

00:20:49.270 --> 00:20:50.270
Question.

00:20:50.650 --> 00:20:51.610
A quiz?

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:55.110
What is the max number of
24-dimensional spheres can you surround

00:20:55.110 --> 00:21:00.580
a spherical body without any type or repetition or collision?

00:21:00.870 --> 00:21:03.870
What? There's no way I know that.

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:06.370
You have 100 seconds to answer.

00:21:06.670 --> 00:21:07.670
Start!

00:21:19.510 --> 00:21:22.430
What do I do? What <i>can</i> I do?!

00:21:27.520 --> 00:21:29.270
30 seconds remaining.

00:21:43.290 --> 00:21:47.410
Who cares, just stop!
We give up, we lost.

00:21:48.040 --> 00:21:51.920
It's over, we'll do whatever you want.

00:21:51.920 --> 00:21:56.840
I'll see to it that Nyaruko, Kuuko,
and Hasuta partner up with you.

00:21:56.840 --> 00:22:00.970
So please, give Nyaruko back her strength. Do you hear me?!

00:22:01.260 --> 00:22:02.720
Answer me!

00:22:07.230 --> 00:22:08.480
Mahiro-san...

00:22:11.100 --> 00:22:17.110
If you do that... you'll become a criminal.

00:22:19.570 --> 00:22:24.740
What are you saying?
I won't be a criminal if nobody finds out.

00:22:25.910 --> 00:22:32.080
No... I hate the idea of you being a criminal!

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:35.460
You're wrong. That was one of your sayings!

00:22:37.050 --> 00:22:37.960
Wait a second...

00:22:38.920 --> 00:22:41.890
You're not a criminal if nobody finds out.

00:22:41.890 --> 00:22:44.390
Even the memories from then...

00:22:46.350 --> 00:22:48.140
It's okay.

00:22:49.480 --> 00:22:53.810
Even if I lose all of my memories...

00:22:53.810 --> 00:22:59.780
I swear I will never lose my feelings for you, Mahiro-san.

00:23:02.410 --> 00:23:07.370
I love you so much, Mahiro-san!

00:23:11.670 --> 00:23:13.000
You idiot.

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:20.510
Do you mean it?

00:23:21.840 --> 00:23:22.840
Yes.

00:23:23.300 --> 00:23:24.840
I will never forget.

00:23:25.510 --> 00:23:29.560
I guarantee it. I promise.

00:23:40.320 --> 00:23:41.070
Over there!

00:23:42.030 --> 00:23:42.950
Hiro-kun!

00:23:44.240 --> 00:23:45.120
Nyaruko!

00:23:46.700 --> 00:23:48.950
We've seen some nice things.

00:23:48.950 --> 00:23:53.250
It was well worth making all of that top secret stuff.

00:23:54.830 --> 00:23:56.880
Let us wait some more...

00:23:56.880 --> 00:24:00.340
I have a feeling it's going to get even more delicious.

00:24:01.800 --> 00:24:02.630
So...

00:24:03.590 --> 00:24:06.470
I'll let you ripen some more.

00:24:07.050 --> 00:24:08.470
And then...

00:24:17.020 --> 00:24:18.400
Have a good day!

00:24:18.400 --> 00:24:20.280
See you later!

00:24:21.780 --> 00:24:25.320
I can't really remember anything
that happened yesterday, to tell the truth.

00:24:26.280 --> 00:24:29.620
I vaguely recall going to some attraction...

00:24:29.620 --> 00:24:32.750
But when I realized it, I was at some weird place.

00:24:34.080 --> 00:24:36.670
Memories of that day completely disappeared.

00:24:37.880 --> 00:24:40.420
It looks like it's the same thing with Nyaruko.

00:24:49.140 --> 00:24:50.720
Good morning, Yasaka-kun.

00:24:50.720 --> 00:24:52.350
Good morning, Yoichi.

00:24:52.350 --> 00:24:54.140
Hey guys, did you see the news?!

00:24:54.140 --> 00:24:57.810
They said the attraction we went to yesterday,
suddenly disappeared in one day!

00:24:57.810 --> 00:25:00.610
I wonder what happened...
What a mystery, don't you think?

00:25:00.610 --> 00:25:03.320
Oh, yeah. I know right.

00:25:06.070 --> 00:25:06.910
What's this?

00:25:08.160 --> 00:25:09.620
Yasaka Mahiro-sama.

00:25:10.450 --> 00:25:11.580
Salutations.

00:25:11.700 --> 00:25:17.460
The Space-nano machines that were infecting Nyaruko...

00:25:17.460 --> 00:25:19.920
were destroyed thanks to an anti-space vaccine inside of your body.

00:25:20.540 --> 00:25:25.550
That's why exchanging some of your
bodily fluid was able to save her.

00:25:26.260 --> 00:25:29.050
You know what comes next... right?

00:25:30.100 --> 00:25:34.770
Oh yeah, the things with Mitsuyu was a joke.

00:25:34.770 --> 00:25:36.350
Don't let it bother you.

00:25:36.350 --> 00:25:38.230
What is this?

00:25:38.230 --> 00:25:43.020
E-E-E-Exchanging bodily fluids?! Yasaka-kun...
does that mean you and Nyaruko-chan...

00:25:45.150 --> 00:25:49.530
Mahiro-san... when did you inject your bodily fluids into me?

00:25:49.530 --> 00:25:50.280
Hey!

00:25:51.740 --> 00:25:55.950
Boy, you promised you'd have a baby with me first.

00:25:55.950 --> 00:25:57.160
Hold up!

00:25:57.620 --> 00:26:01.290
Mahiro-kun! Exchange bodily fluids with me too!

00:26:01.290 --> 00:26:03.090
What the hell are <i>you</i> saying?!

00:26:03.960 --> 00:26:04.960
Mahiro-san!

00:26:06.550 --> 00:26:08.050
What do you want?
